    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core of Magic is set in a high fantasy world where you can play as a Mage, Druid or Blood Summoner killing monsters, collecting loot, and solving quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The game world exists of leveling hubs where you can wait for monsters to spawn, but there is      also a small overall world where you can do quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Wilderness areas become available by completing quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The game world consists of 3 acts that become available to you as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>How many quests are there? And what futures?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 13 main quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 11 side quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 Uber quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- the game has more than 400 items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Items in the game include white, magic, unique, and rare types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a03 difficulty settings: Normal, Nightmare, Hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Note: There are no microtransactions in the game despite it being free to play</strong></u></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core of Magic is set in a high fantasy world where you can play as a Mage, Druid or Blood Summoner killing monsters, collecting loot, and solving quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The game world exists of leveling hubs where you can wait for monsters to spawn, but there is      also a small overall world where you can do quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Wilderness areas become available by completing quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The game world consists of 3 acts that become available to you as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>How many quests are there? And what futures?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 13 main quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 11 side quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 Uber quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- the game has more than 400 items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Items in the game include white, magic, unique, and rare types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a03 difficulty settings: Normal, Nightmare, Hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Note: There are no microtransactions in the game despite it being free to play</strong></u></p>",
